  "label": "The text 'when you are white and stole your first bike' maps onto the defiant child visual",
  "description": "The text implies that the visual of the defiant child represents a white person who stole their first bike. The girl's defiant posture and expression are used analogically to represent the 'white person' committing the act of stealing a bike, which the text frames as a noteworthy or significant event due to racial categorization. The visual material (the girl) is mapped onto the textual concept (the white person who stole a bike).",
